{"unit_id":"YJLTF__dsh-vision-tool#card-zh","repo":"YJLTF/dsh-vision-tool","commit":"674b1c761ff8f177b6d182977381f5b3a5e92a60","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-tool（DSH 插件，web 客户端）：为纯文本主模型补充图片理解能力。它注册会话图片查看工具，并在文本模型需要理解图片时调用配置的小型多模态模型，将视觉回答转成文本返回；模型原生支持图片时会退避。主要功能包括理解会话最近图片、查看会话图片列表、指定路径识图、按模型模态注入提示，以及在网页插件管理页配置模型。适合需要让文本模型处理截图或图片的 DSH 用户。使用前需配置视觉模型提供方和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:70-97","src/tool-understand-image.ts:84-120","src/client/index.ts:164-190"]}
{"unit_id":"YJLTF__dsh-vision-tool#card-en","repo":"YJLTF/dsh-vision-tool","commit":"674b1c761ff8f177b6d182977381f5b3a5e92a60","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-tool helps text-only DSH models understand images. Tools inspect the latest conversation image, list available images, or analyze a file with a configured vision model and return text. Native multimodal handling remains intact. Configure the vision model in web settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:70-97","src/tool-understand-image.ts:84-120","src/client/index.ts:164-190"]}
